user nails-web on >nails-web-dev-redis-password resetkeys ~nails-web:* resetchannels -@all +get +set +del +getdel +incr +expire +ping
user spa-web on >spa-web-dev-redis-password resetkeys ~spa-web:* resetchannels -@all +get +set +del +getdel +incr +expire +ping
